Problem statement
Sort a finite sequence using QuickSort.

Expected input
A finite sequence of comparable elements.

Expected output
A sequence that is sorted and is a permutation of the input.

Procedure
Choose a pivot from the input.
Partition the input into smaller, equal, and greater parts.
Recursively sort the smaller part.
Recursively sort the greater part.
Concatenate the sorted smaller part, equal part, and sorted greater part.